/*
 * snippet::layout — arranging the places a diagnostic names into excerpts.
 *
 * This is the one decision maker of the module: the throw site says what it
 * points at, in whatever order suited it, and `layout` says which excerpt each
 * place lands in, in what order, and which lines stand between them. Every
 * width it counts is counted on plain source text, cf. `snippet::piece`.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::snippet::layout
 * @File: ymirc/errors/snippet/layout.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-08
